{"sourceUrl":"http://scea.whut.edu.cn/yjsjy/zsxx/202509/t20250915_1349005.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:13.614337+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://scea.whut.edu.cn/yjsjy/zsxx/202509/t20250915_1349005.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）</span></span></span><span><span>招收推免生本科毕业专业限制</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>土木工程学科及土木水利专业领域限接收土木工程、给排水科学与工程、工程管理、建筑环境与能源应用工程等相关专业的应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>建筑学及城乡规划学专业限接收建筑学、城乡规划学等相关专业的应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>低空技术与工程专业限接收土木工程、建筑学、城乡规划、交通运输工程、信息与通信工程、材料科学与工程、力学、航空工程、智能科学与技术、控制科学与工程等相关专业应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）招收推免生相关学术条件要求</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，社会主义信念坚定，社会责任感强，遵纪守法，积极向上，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀；学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向，能取得现就读院校的推荐免试资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>品行表现优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>申请本科直博者，应具有较强的科研创新能力和培养潜力。请申请本科直博的考生务必在报名前与拟报考导师联系，取得该导师同意后方可报考，并致电备案。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、招生类别和招生人数</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）本科直博生</span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>序号</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业名称</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业代码</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学习形式</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>拟招生人数</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（海南专项）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>低空技术与工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>0814J1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span>注：本科直博生实际招生人数可根据实际情况做适当调整</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）硕士研究生</span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>序号</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业名称</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业代码</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学习形式</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>拟招生人数</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>建筑学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081300</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>城乡规划学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>083300</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（岩土工程）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>01</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（结构工程、防灾减灾工程及防护工程）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>02</span></span><span><span>）（</span></span><span><span>03</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>5</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（桥隧工程）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>04</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（市政工程）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>05</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（供热、供燃气通风及空调工程）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>06</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>8</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（土木工程建造与管理）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>081400</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>07</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>9</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085901</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>30</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>10</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>市政工程（含给排水等）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085905</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>11</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>人工环境工程（含供热、通风及空调等）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085906</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>12</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>土木工程（海南专项）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085901</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>2</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>14</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>建筑</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085100</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>15</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>低空技术与工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>0814J1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span>注：</span></span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>硕士研究生实际招生人数可根据实际情况做适当调整；</span></span></p><p>    <span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>土木工程（</span></span><span><span>085901</span></span><span><span>），包含结构工程、岩土工程、桥梁与隧道工程、土木工程建造与管理等方向。</span></span></p><p><span><span>三、申请、复试、录取工作安排</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院组织有预报名环节，请有意愿报考我院的推免生务必及时进行预报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>预报名阶段为</span></span><span><span><strong>2025</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>15</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>日上午</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span><span><strong>:00</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>至</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>17</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>24:00</strong></span></span><span><span>，获得所在高校推免资格的考生，请通过武汉理工大学土木工程与建筑学院预推免报名系统填报志愿。我院对报名考生的材料进行审核后，通知符合条件的考生参加考核。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>.</span><span></span></span><span><span>考生登录学校预推免报名系统（网址：</span></span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325vXBW3</span><span><span>），线上报名，同时将教育部学信网学籍验证报告、加盖公章的获得推免资格证明（或处于推免公示期证明）、本科成绩单（加盖公章）、外语水平证明、公开发表的科研水平和综合能力佐证材料（如正式发表的论文、专利授权、省级及以上获奖证书）等材料，</span></span><span><span><strong>制作成一个</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>文件</strong></span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>10M</span></span><span><span>以内），</span></span><span><span><strong>以“姓名</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>+</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>推免生</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>+</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>拟报考专业”命名</strong></span></span><span><span>，上传至系统中“文件上传”中的“其他”选项。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>.</span><span></span></span><span><span>学院成立推免生复试专家小组，坚持贯彻公平、公正、公开的原则，落实集体议事和集体决策制度，以提高选拔质量为核心，完善全面考查、突出能力考查，强化对考生科研创新潜质和专业能力倾向的考核。推免生专家复试小组负责审核报名考生的资料，确定入围名单。根据考生的复试成绩，结合申请材料和素质考核的结果，综合评价，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>.</span><span></span></span><span><span>考核方式及内容：我院采用线上面试进行综合能力复试考核，具体考核时间及安排由考务组在考前通知。学院将在面试结束后，通过电子邮箱，择优向通过复试考核的学生发放预录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>对参加我院预报名并通过复试考核的考生，务必在教育部“推免服务系统”开放</span></span><span><span><span>后（即</span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2025</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>22</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>日上午</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>：</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>00</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>开始</span></span></span><span><span><span>），登</span></span></span><span><span>录中国研招网“推免服务系统”（网址：</span></span><span><span><a href=\"https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</a></span></span><span><span>）填报志愿，网上完成接收并确认我院的复试及待录取通知等环节。学院将依据报名顺序发放待录取通知，额满为止。逾期未正式报名的，不能保证预留计划额度。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>我院在中国研招网“推免服务系统”发放复试通知或待录取通知后，若超出规定时间考生未接受，且经学院电话确认后，可撤销对考生的复试通知或待录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>考生要在规定时间内通过中国研招网“推免服务系统”确认同意待录取，一旦操作不可更改。逾期未确认考生，视为放弃待录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.</span></span><span><span>针对预报名的考生录取结束后，如有计划余额，学院将根据中国研招网“推免服务系统”中的报名情况进行补录。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>四、注意事项</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，一经发现申请人提交的材料内容不真实或不准确，将取消拟录取或录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>请保持电话和邮件的畅通。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>申请人目录查询、信息注册、上传照片、缴费、填报志愿、接收复试和待录取等都在“推免服务系统”上进行，已被武汉理工大学接收的推免生，不得再报名参加当年的研究生考试招生，否则取消其攻读硕士学位研究生或直博生的录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></p><p>    <span><span>联系人：蔡老师</span></span></p><p>    <span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span>027-87165906</span></span></p><p>    <span><span>地址：武汉市洪山区珞狮路</span></span><span><span>122</span></span><span><span>号武汉理工大学土木工程与建筑学院</span></span></p><p>    <span><span>邮编：</span></span><span><span>430070</span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学土木工程与建筑学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"64e7aac6179f26225d963b5cc09f5f2228a3e4c6e92d128b18ee765a018e5e01","textLength":2296,"sourceSha256":"507b56a4cd2988ecc6f44124c27e7bba0efce0f7f43139a232f45b1c6dc00289","selector":".content_text","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-061705fb849ea3909e1a","title":"2025年武汉理工大学土木工程与建筑学院2026年推荐免试攻读硕士学位和直接攻读博士学位研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:13.614337+00:00"}
